---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ExecutiveCallout from '../../components/ExecutiveCallout.astro';
---

<Layout title="AI Concepts and Infrastructure — Rycode Intelligence">
  <div class="glitch-overlay"></div>
  <div class="viewport-matrix-container">
    <canvas id="networkCanvas"></canvas>
  </div>

  <!-- Full-Width Focused Hero Header -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <p class="hero-eyebrow">INTELLIGENCE VAULT · A.I. SYSTEMS</p>
        <h1 class="hero-title">AI Concepts and Infrastructure</h1>
        <p class="hero-tagline">
          An empirical analytical portal covering frontier AI model benchmarks, model architectures, silicon supply chains, low-precision inference engineering, data center power infrastructure, and prompt engineering mechanics.
        </p>
        
        <ExecutiveCallout title="EXECUTIVE PORTAL OVERVIEW">
          This portal translates complex artificial intelligence engineering into actionable strategic insights for non-technical stakeholders. Whether evaluating model capability (Evals), semiconductor bottlenecks (Ecosystem), serving costs (Inference), or clean energy grid self-sufficiency (Power), each module bridges raw engineering data with clear business, financial, and governance outcomes.
        </ExecutiveCallout>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="#categories" class="btn-primary">Explore Research Modules ↓</a>
          <a href="/" class="btn-secondary">← Central Hub</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Full-Width Research Categories Index -->
  <section class="section" id="categories">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <p class="section-eyebrow">RESEARCH INDEX</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">Research Categories</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Select a category below to explore empirical metrics, interactive tools, and system analyses.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Single Integrated Glass Container -->
      <div class="directory-container">
        <!-- Category 1 -->
        <a href="/ai/glossary" class="dir-row">
          <div class="dir-meta">
            <span class="dir-num">01 // SAMPLING</span>
            <span class="dir-tag">PARAMETERS</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dir-content">
            <h3 class="dir-title">Glossary & Sampling Parameters</h3>
            <p class="dir-desc">Comprehensive glossary of 89 indexed AI terms and interactive parameter simulators (temperature, top_p, top_k, context window, KV cache).</p>
            <span class="relevance-badge">💡 Strategic Relevance: Estimate GPU VRAM hardware requirements & configure LLM hyperparameter presets.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dir-action">
            <span>Explore Category</span>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Category 2 -->
        <a href="/ai/benchmarks" class="dir-row">
          <div class="dir-meta">
            <span class="dir-num">02 // EVALS</span>
            <span class="dir-tag">BENCHMARKS</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dir-content">
            <h3 class="dir-title">Model Benchmarks & Architectures</h3>
            <p class="dir-desc">Frontier LLM evaluations (SWE-bench, GDPval Elo, ARC-AGI-3) and 15-slide Frontier Model Architecture & Economics deck.</p>
            <span class="relevance-badge">💡 Strategic Relevance: Select the optimal AI model for software development vs corporate knowledge work.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dir-action">
            <span>Explore Category</span>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Category 3 -->
        <a href="/ai/supply-chain" class="dir-row">
          <div class="dir-meta">
            <span class="dir-num">03 // ECOSYSTEM</span>
            <span class="dir-tag">SUPPLY CHAIN</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dir-content">
            <h3 class="dir-title">Supply Chain & Semiconductor Ecosystem</h3>
            <p class="dir-desc">8-tier semiconductor directory (Synopsys, ASML, TSMC, NVIDIA, SK Hynix) spanning 32 top global infrastructure companies.</p>
            <span class="relevance-badge">💡 Strategic Relevance: Identify geopolitical risks & hardware choke points in semiconductor investments.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dir-action">
            <span>Explore Category</span>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Category 4 -->
        <a href="/ai/inference" class="dir-row">
          <div class="dir-meta">
            <span class="dir-num">04 // SYSTEMS</span>
            <span class="dir-tag">INFERENCE</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dir-content">
            <h3 class="dir-title">Inference Engineering & Optimization</h3>
            <p class="dir-desc">Low-precision NVFP4/FP8 quantization scaling, safetensors zero-copy mmap loading, and serving engines (vLLM, SGLang, TensorRT-LLM).</p>
            <span class="relevance-badge">💡 Strategic Relevance: Balance user response speed against GPU cloud API budgets.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dir-action">
            <span>Explore Category</span>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Category 5 -->
        <a href="/ai/energy-compute" class="dir-row">
          <div class="dir-meta">
            <span class="dir-num">05 // INFRASTRUCTURE</span>
            <span class="dir-tag">ENERGETICS</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dir-content">
            <h3 class="dir-title">Energy & Power Grid Infrastructure</h3>
            <p class="dir-desc">13-slide 2030 AI Factory Blueprint deck, 1 GW SMR nuclear baseload power, and closed-loop liquid cooling infographics.</p>
            <span class="relevance-badge">💡 Strategic Relevance: Evaluate clean nuclear SMR energy & 95% water reduction cooling efficiency (PUE).</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dir-action">
            <span>Explore Category</span>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Category 6 -->
        <a href="/ai/prompt-engineering" class="dir-row">
          <div class="dir-meta">
            <span class="dir-num">06 // MECHANISTICS</span>
            <span class="dir-tag">PROMPTING</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dir-content">
            <h3 class="dir-title">Prompt Engineering & Mechanistics</h3>
            <p class="dir-desc">Transformer induction heads, Function Vector (FV) heads, complexity classes (TC⁰ to P-Time), and prompt sandbox simulators.</p>
            <span class="relevance-badge">💡 Strategic Relevance: Master structured prompt architecture to maximize output accuracy & reliability.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dir-action">
            <span>Explore Category</span>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Category 7 -->
        <a href="/ai/macroeconomics" class="dir-row">
          <div class="dir-meta">
            <span class="dir-num">07 // POLICY</span>
            <span class="dir-tag">MACROECONOMICS</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dir-content">
            <h3 class="dir-title">Dispelling AI Job Loss & Resource Myths</h3>
            <p class="dir-desc">Vanguard 2026 labor study (+3.8% wage premium), MIT Autor expertise framework, mega-bank case studies, and municipal grid decoupling facts.</p>
            <span class="relevance-badge">💡 Strategic Relevance: Boardroom briefing data disproving AI job loss and municipal water grid displacement.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dir-action">
            <span>Explore Category</span>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .relevance-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #2563eb;
      background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.06);
      padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin-top: 0.35rem;
    }
  </style>

  <script>
    import '../../scripts/matrix.js';
  </script>
</Layout>
